    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="28.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIAtr">VI Atr</ref> 28.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ swicollice dæda ⁊ laðlice unlaga ascunige man swyðe, þæt is false gewihta ⁊ woge gemeta ⁊ lease gewitnessa ⁊ fracodlice ficunga ⁊ fule forligra ⁊ egeslice mánswara</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And deceitful deeds and hateful injustices shall be strictly avoided, namely, untrue weights, and false measures, and lying testimonies,</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">[Not in D]</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
